  "body": "Apologies if this isn't the best place to ask this. I am looking for a way to track changes to the HTML standard, preferably for a [particular spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html) (in this case images). Ideally, I'd like some sort of webhook/feed that my organization can consume to keep up with any new changes.\r\n\r\nThe closest thing I can think of is subscribing to the [HTML twitter](https://twitter.com/htmlstandard) but that isn't easily filterable. Would love to hear some ideas on how others have worked around this. ",
